{\b DWMB AIO Client \'96 Before You Install}\par
\par
DWMB (\'93Don\'92t Wallop Me Bro\'94) passively watches VATSIM FSD network traffic on this PC for private messages and on-frequency messages addressed to your callsign, and forwards them to the DWMB server, which relays them to you on Discord. It never sends anything on the network and never transmits on your behalf.\par
\par
{\b VATSIM Code of Conduct.} DWMB is meant to help you comply with the VATSIM Code of Conduct, not replace it. You must remain able to respond to ATC or a Supervisor while connected \'96 use DWMB while doing things around the house, not while driving.\par
\par
{\b Npcap required.} Packet capture needs a libpcap-compatible driver. Install Npcap (https://npcap.com) separately if you haven't already; it is not bundled with this installer.\par
\par
